<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - U S West lowered on price.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - U S West lowered on price.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter analyst Guy Woodlief said he downgraded U S West Communications Group due to the stock's price.</p>
<p>-- The stock had neared his price target of $35, he said.</p>
<p>-- He said he made no changes to his earnings forecasts on the company.</p>
<p>-- Its shares were off 1/4 at 34-3/8.</p>
</text>
